        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08758v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T17:55:53Z",
        "description": "Scientific ideas rarely start from a blank page. They inherit mechanisms, repair known limitations, and recombine pieces of earlier work, much like biological genomes. Current benchmarks still say little about whether AI systems can follow this inheritance structure. We present IdeaGene-Bench (IG-Be",
        "title_cn": "创意有基因组：标杆科学谱系推理和基于谱系的创意生成"
