        "description": "While UMAP is widely used for exploring high-dimensional data, typical workflows focus on its lower-dimensional embedding, largely overlooking the rich k-nearest-neighbor (kNN) graph that UMAP constructs internally. This graph encodes the data manifold in its original high-dimensional space, before ",
        "title_cn": "降维与网络科学相遇：在UMAP的kNN图上进行感知"
      },
      {
