        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08743v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T17:45:25Z",
        "description": "We present SACRA-K (SimulAtor for Compact objects in Relativistic Astrophysics with Kokkos), a performance-portable numerical relativity code ported from the Fortran code SACRA-MPI to C++ with the Kokkos library. SACRA-K retains the physics and numerical methods of SACRA-MPI, namely a Baumgarte-Shap",
        "title_cn": "SACRA-K ：使用Kokkos的性能可移植数值相对论代码"
      },
      {
        "title": "Competing Chern states revealed by quasiparticle charging in moiré rhombohedral graphene",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08710v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T17:20:31Z",
        "description": "Moiré materials realize a versatile platform for exploring the physics of fractional Chern insulators (FCIs). The recently observed evolution from FCIs to an extended quantum anomalous Hall background upon lowering the electronic temperature in moiré rhombohedral graphene (mRG)8 raises a fundamental",
        "title_cn": "通过莫尔菱形石墨烯中的准粒子充电揭示的相互竞争的Chern态"
      },
