        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08699v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T16:59:19Z",
        "description": "To date, 14 polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons (PAHs) ranging in size from two to seven (including five- and six-membered) carbon rings have been detected in the starless dense core TMC-1 CP within the Taurus molecular cloud. Their detection raises questions about the distribution of PAHs in the cold ",
        "title_cn": "极低光度物体（ VeLLO ） MC27/L1521F中多环芳烃苯（ C $_{13} $ H $_{10} $ ）的检测"
      },
