        "description": "Modern Video Object Segmentation (VOS) involves tracking and segmenting user-specified targets. While recent approaches have achieved remarkable performance in single-target scenarios, extending them to multi-target settings typically involves replicating the single-target processing for each indivi",
        "title_cn": "SAM-MT ：实时交互式多目标视频分割"
