        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T16:47:12Z",
        "description": "Integrating epitaxial thin films of ferroelectric PbTiO3 and paraelectric SrTiO3 into artificially layered periodic superlattices provides a unique platform for tuning strain, depolarization, and interfacial/surface energies, thereby accessing a rich phase diagram of topological polar structures (sk",
        "title_cn": "铁电PbTiO3/SrTiO3超晶格中复杂极性超结构控制的热导率"
