        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08680v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T16:43:15Z",
        "description": "Magnetic fields generated by the Rayleigh-Taylor instability were measured in laser-accelerated planar foils using ultrafast proton radiography. Thin plastic foils were irradiated with $\\sim$4-kJ, 2.5-ns laser pulses focused to an intensity of $\\sim$10$^{14}$ W$/$cm$^{2}$ on the OMEGA EP Laser Syste",
        "title_cn": "激光驱动磁场的精确映射及其在高能密度等离子体中的演化"
      },
