        "title": "Inverse Transfer and Coherence in Rotating Stratified Flow with Clouds and Phase Transitions",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08673v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-09T16:36:46Z",
        "description": "Inverse energy transfer to large-scale coherent structures in idealized models of geophysical flows has been of interest for over four decades. Extensive knowledge exists regarding inverse transfer in rotating and stratified dry dynamics, characterized by the Rossby number and a single dry Froude nu",
        "title_cn": "旋转分层流与云和相变的逆向转移和相干性"
